flowchart LR
    Client --> Frontend
    Frontend --> Workers[Prefill / Decode or aggregated workers]
    Frontend -->|metrics scrape| Prometheus
    Prometheus -->|traffic queries| Planner
    Workers -->|FPM via Runtime Event Plane| Planner
    Planner -->|desired worker replicas| Connector[Kubernetes Connector]
    Connector -->|DGDSA scale or legacy DGD update| Operator
    Operator -->|reconcile workload| Workers
    Workers -->|register / withdraw ready endpoints| Discovery
    Discovery -->|admitted membership updates| Frontend
    Planner -->|own diagnostics| PlannerMetrics[Planner metrics :9085]
